OL,3,GNEWSA'Truly special' site named
OL,4,ANational Nature Reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nature reserve established to improve
OL,7,Fwildlife habitats and offset the
OL,8,Fbuilding of new homes has been
OL,9,Fdesignated a National Nature Reserve.
OL,11,FDorset Wildlife Trust (DWT) and Natural
OL,12,FEngland bought 833 acres (335 hectares)
OL,13,Fof farmland and chalk downland at
OL,14,FLyscombe, north east of Dorchester, in
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FNatural England said the landscape,
OL,18,Fwhich is home to rare orchids and
OL,19,Fbutterflies, would join the King's
OL,20,FSeries of National Nature Reserves
OL,21,F(NNR).
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
